mand`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"246d88ef5c1078d27705e0b71510fb18","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"24998285e886ee30f230af3b53c0be08","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ec91e92aa97a9f6c6890b698381c93f1","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"e79847ef7ff7a2198764aa71b6053840","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"37e20a5795efe8f6907d1b3057122473","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"1dc25cb940cead98ced6e0e9c4c318ec","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"29bdc98af7edb3fc68caf6ed2f08a5ac","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"f2477dd931205b7cd4bd2ba08fceca0d","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"8961d9cd629aec74a56fcb75f94a9a6c","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794939725674,"stop":1794939725777,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","val